            <p class="location-card-excerpt">
              Floating houseboat pontoons, 5,000 brass nilavilakku oil lamps, and traditional Chenda Melam celebrations.
            </p>
            <div class="location-card-footer">
              <span class="location-card-guest-count">Capacity: 250 Guests</span>
              <button type="button" class="location-card-btn" data-open-location="kerala-kumarakom">
                <span>Explore Gallery</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12.293 5.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l4 4a1 1 0 010 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L14.586 11H3a1 1 0 110-2h11.586l-2.293-2.293a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Slide-in Event Preview Drawer -->
  <div class="location-drawer-backdrop" id="location-drawer-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <aside class="location-drawer" id="location-drawer" aria-label="Event showcase and venue details" aria-hidden="true" inert>
    <div class="location-drawer-header">
      <div class="location-drawer-title-group">
        <span class="location-drawer-city" id="drawer-city">Udaipur, Rajasthan</span>
        <h2 class="location-drawer-title" id="drawer-title">Jagmandir Island Palace</h2>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="location-drawer-close" id="location-drawer-close" aria-label="Close venue details drawer">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="location-drawer-content">
      <!-- Photo Gallery Viewer -->
      <div class="drawer-gallery">
        <div class="drawer-main-photo-wrap">
          <img
            id="drawer-main-img"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
            alt="Main showcase photo"
            class="drawer-main-photo"
          />
          <span class="drawer-photo-counter" id="drawer-photo-counter">1 of 4</span>
        </div>
        <div class="drawer-thumbs-row" id="drawer-thumbs-row" role="tablist" aria-label="Venue photo thumbnails">
          <!-- Dynamically populated thumbnails -->
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Specifications Grid -->
      <div class="drawer-specs-grid">
        <div class="drawer-spec-item">
          <span class="drawer-spec-label">Format</span>
          <span class="drawer-spec-value" id="drawer-event-type">3-Day Destination Wedding</span>
        </div>
        <div class="drawer-spec-item">
          <span class="drawer-spec-label">Guest Capacity</span>
          <span class="drawer-spec-value" id="drawer-guests">450 Guests</span>
        </div>
        <div class="drawer-spec-item">
          <span class="drawer-spec-label">Host Venue</span>
          <span class="drawer-spec-value" id="drawer-venue">Jagmandir Palace</span>
        </div>
        <div class="drawer-spec-item">
          <span class="drawer-spec-label">Best Window</span>
          <span class="drawer-spec-value" id="drawer-season">October &ndash; March</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Production Narrative -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="drawer-highlights-title">Production &amp; Scenography Narrative</h3>
        <p class="drawer-narrative" id="drawer-narrative">
          Produced in the heart of Lake Pichola, this multi-day wedding transformed Jagmandir Island into a floating fairytale with private royal boat flotillas, floating mandaps, and synchronized fireworks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Highlights Checklist -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="drawer-highlights-title">Signature Eventina Inclusions</h3>
        <ul class="drawer-highlights-list" id="drawer-highlights">
          <!-- Dynamically populated list -->
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Action CTAs -->
      <div class="drawer-actions">
        <a href="/enquiry" id="drawer-enquiry-btn" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">
          <span>Plan an Event at this Venue</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 10H16M11 5L16 10L11 15" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/portfolio" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%;">
          <span>View Full Portfolio Archive</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- Leaflet JavaScript CDN strictly on locations page -->
  <script is:inline src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=" crossorigin=""></script>
  <!-- Interactive Map Controller -->
  <script is:inline src="/assets/js/map.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
